  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T06:49:25.786639Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T07:03:09.081366Z",
  "totalBlocks": 23,
  "translatedBlocks": 23,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60f00f56ed85b8e5",
      "translationZh": "我是一名独立研究者。由于预算限制，我将原本计划在 64 张 H100 上进行的 21B MoE 预训练转移到单张 NVIDIA GH200 上（每小时 2.29），并将这一过程中测得的指标整理成了一篇论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74a9bd8fb8b85491",
      "translationZh": "我希望这能帮助那些预算有限、刚开始接触 LLM 的人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "286b052bc92f1f38",
      "translationZh": "以下是我在结合现有技术的过程中，于各个阶段记录的指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "149c7c7d3a523ef0",
      "translationZh": "模型：MoE，总参数量为 20.99B，激活参数量为 3.36B（30 层，从 64 个专家中选择 4 个）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0449ed8a5fd3adc",
      "translationZh": "238.5 GiB 的 FP32 训练数据全部存储在 CPU 内存中，GPU 的优化器内核通过 NVLink-C2C 直接对其进行更新",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66a7d8d13fbfdfb7",
      "translationZh": "云服务商将 GPU 功耗上限设为 700 W",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad563a8c9dc0b773",
      "translationZh": "基准测试 MFU：21.1% → 50.7%（13 个测量点，其中一个涉及模型变更）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc20057b8c743e06",
      "translationZh": "真实数据训练 MFU：36.5% → 48.9–49.1%（10.9B tokens；从 4B tokens 开始，通过 DiLoCo 连接两张 GH200）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9f35f9d58628b1f",
      "translationZh": "计入同步时间后，我们估计这一数值为 47.6–47.8%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ee669ac85d8bfec",
      "translationZh": "失败的情况也很少",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b30fb474ac9f4ff9",
      "translationZh": "Transformer Engine FP8、逐行 FP8：GEMM 变得更快，但量化内核变得更慢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1981deb77f80987",
      "translationZh": "将所有激活值卸载到 CPU 的方法；在 GPU 和 CPU 之间进行累积分区",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc0994383bb6e436",
      "translationZh": "CPU 加法问题：尽管设置完全相同，每次运行的速度仍在 22% 和 32% 之间波动（已通过 C++ OpenMP 内核解决）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5a24d5cd1acd0e0",
      "translationZh": "只测试了一个模型和一种硬件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50ffff366c7b0ae8",
      "translationZh": "各阶段的指标并非严格的消融测试，因为它们混用了不同的代码版本和测量方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58aa6a1ab771f240",
      "translationZh": "我们未能验证 FP8 对质量的影响",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02150a32dc3623b4",
      "translationZh": "我们只涵盖了 Stage 1 最开始的约 11B 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7c30ed37be13200",
      "translationZh": "代码、基准测试记录和训练日志：https://github.com/DW-dev-UE/LLM-from-scratch/tree/main/apex3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0c03b47bb8cff7b",
      "translationZh": "论文：https://zenodo.org/records/23316135",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b28a84d1f8b17f37",
      "translationZh": "如果你发现测量方法或数值分析中有任何错误，请告诉我。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66f5ce93bda6ebe2",
      "translationZh": "我目前在 21B 上进行预训练时，正在观察到更多涌现能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09ded1e783924f54",
      "translationZh": "此外，如果有机会，我也想把这篇论文提交到 Arvix 🫠",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d7f47466e0a0767",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Prestigious-Taste-63 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
